1
00:00:00,256 --> 00:00:04,877
Choose Deploy, then Foundation VM for a classic Foundation deployment.

2
00:00:05,077 --> 00:00:08,995
Enter the actual Foundation endpoint, not a future host or cluster

3
00:00:09,131 --> 00:00:13,300
address. Confirm that Foundation can reach the physical management, host

4
00:00:13,436 --> 00:00:15,753
and controller virtual machine networks.

5
00:00:15,996 --> 00:00:18,313
Keep its session separate from other deployments.

6
00:00:18,662 --> 00:00:23,219
Refresh image inventory and select the exact approved AOS package already

7
00:00:23,227 --> 00:00:27,579
present. Typing a filename or choosing a local upload file does not stage

8
00:00:27,579 --> 00:00:31,976
it. If upload is required, wait for its result and refresh inventory.

9
00:00:32,123 --> 00:00:36,253
Supply the real hypervisor checksum and review every node identity,

10
00:00:36,475 --> 00:00:38,780
address and saved credential reference.

11
00:00:39,105 --> 00:00:43,620
Refresh inventory, Validate native payload, Test IPMI credentials

12
00:00:43,671 --> 00:00:46,948
and Check progress have separate running and result feedback.

13
00:00:47,084 --> 00:00:50,200
Review each outcome rather than assuming the click passed.

14
00:00:50,473 --> 00:00:54,390
The IPMI panel reports per-node results and the test source.

15
00:00:54,611 --> 00:00:58,700
A direct Orchestrator routing failure does not prove Foundation cannot reach

16
00:00:58,708 --> 00:01:03,080
the controller. Dry Run checks the reviewed intent without submitting imaging.

17
00:01:03,288 --> 00:01:07,802
Resolve schema, credential-reference, image and connectivity blockers.

18
00:01:07,981 --> 00:01:11,674
Have the required approver review the exact destructive scope.

19
00:01:11,841 --> 00:01:14,329
Imaging selected nodes can overwrite them;

20
00:01:14,359 --> 00:01:17,664
do not submit a new job just because the browser lost contact.

21
00:01:18,113 --> 00:01:22,457
During an approved deployment, follow the existing job and actual Foundation

22
00:01:22,508 --> 00:01:26,723
phase and percentage. Missing telemetry remains Not reported.

23
00:01:26,880 --> 00:01:29,581
Check progress does not itself start imaging.

24
00:01:29,781 --> 00:01:34,040
Reconcile an interrupted session before another submission, then verify cluster

25
00:01:34,091 --> 00:01:38,120
membership, versions and services before handing off configuration.
